{"type":"Film","id":"FR2023_114","slug":"fr2023-114-umami","title":{"native":"Umami","english":"Umami - A Taste of Happiness"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2023-05-17","year":2023},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Slony Sow","slug":"slony-sow","name":"Slony Sow","birthYear":0,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/30/8/264222/format_page/umami.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.dailymotion.com/video/x8pg0yj"},"synopsis":{"native":"Gabriel Carvin, chef étoilé saumurois, se voit remettre sa troisième étoile de crystal par un critique culinaire. Le soir même, sa femme, Louise, le quitte. Cette brutale séparation déclenche une crise familiale. Pour Gabriel, le trop-plein le foudroie en plein cœur. Victime d’un infarctus, cet hyperactif va devoir à présent vivre loin de ses casseroles.. Ce break salutaire lui permettra peut-être de trouver une autre passion. Pour se changer les idées, il part au Japon, ce qui lui permet de renouer avec les plaisirs simples de l’amitié, et d’essayer de découvrir les mystères de l'umami, la cinquième saveur du palais.","english":"Following a near-death experience, France's leading chef Gabriel Carvin (Gérard Depardieu) throws himself into a quest seeking the flavor that has confounded his life since he was defeated by a Japanese chef's bowl of noodles as a young man."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Japan","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2023_114_01","film":"FR2023_114","person":{"id":"Gérard Depardieu","slug":"gerard-depardieu","name":"Gérard Depardieu","birthYear":1948,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Russian Federation (the)","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2015-084-valley-of-love","title":{"native":"Valley of Love"}},"year":2016,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Actor Male","result":"Nomin